home too much anymore either.

2203
01:14:55,400 --> 01:14:57,233
- Well, I was only wondering
how the boy was doing

2204
01:14:57,233 --> 01:14:59,400
there in training and all that.

2205
01:14:59,400 --> 01:15:01,400
- Sir, as far as I know,
you're boy is doing

2206
01:15:01,400 --> 01:15:02,967
as well as could be expected,

2207
